WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,210 --> 00:00:02,890
Besides, if you really want to rebel, it's just self-defense.

2
00:00:02,890 --> 00:00:04,130
They were the ones who made the first move

3
00:00:04,130 --> 00:00:05,330
That's the truth

4
00:00:05,330 --> 00:00:07,690
If we don't resist then, we will be killed.

5
00:00:07,690 --> 00:00:09,970
It's all my fault for causing you trouble.

6
00:00:09,970 --> 00:00:12,450
Everyone is busy now, but I can only lie down

7
00:00:12,450 --> 00:00:14,930
It's not like you want it to be like this. It's all those people who caused it.

8
00:00:14,930 --> 00:00:17,610
He tried to harm us but failed, so he beat us up and claimed revenge.

9
00:00:17,610 --> 00:00:20,410
It's a good idea that we didn't chase those who escaped.

10
00:00:20,410 --> 00:00:23,330
It's a shame. Just take a good rest and get well soon.

11
00:00:23,330 --> 00:00:24,850
You'll be able to help then

12
00:00:25,850 --> 00:00:30,210
I can meet you, you are really my husband and wife

13
00:00:31,460 --> 00:00:36,860
Such a big boy is still crying like this

14
00:00:36,860 --> 00:00:41,860
Hey, hey, hey, brother, stop feeling guilty and get well soon.

15
00:00:41,860 --> 00:00:44,940
I sent healing medicine to my mouth, but I missed a lot of delicious food.

16
00:00:44,940 --> 00:00:51,490
My dad cooks the best food in the world

17
00:00:51,490 --> 00:00:54,890
You have never given up on me. I will definitely repay you well in the future.

18
00:00:54,890 --> 00:00:57,210
And the big boss, he was the one who asked someone to save me.

19
00:00:57,210 --> 00:00:59,460
I remember it. You're welcome.
